### REGISTER
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ponnu",
    "email": "ponnu@gmail.com",
    "password": "Ponnu@123"
}
### CHECK WALLET
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/wallet/?user_id=2

### ADD MONEY
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/add_money/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 1,
    "amount": 5000
}

### SEND MONEY
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/send_money/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sender_id": 1,
    "receiver_id": 3,
    "amount": 1000
}

### TRANSACTION HISTORY
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions/?user_id=1